  m_Text: "Want to make some quick money? Hehe, but way more easy than carrying shitty
    herbs for this lazy stupid merchant. No it's simple. We play a game. There are
    3 cups. Choose the cup with the coin and you win.\n\nThe price is \t\t\t\t\t\t\tYour
    bet is \n\nIf you pick the wrong one I keep the bet, simple right?"
