    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "Sinjid left the arena, tired, but proud that he had finally fullfilled
    his master's will.\r\rBut upon returning to his master's house, Fujin was gone.
    All that was left was a letter. It read:\r\rSinjid,\rI have left the safe boundaries
    of the mountain to seek out an old friend, who lives far by the northern coastline.
    A Fallen Army, which was once driven away by our forces, has now regrouped and
    is starting to strike from the south. You are to defend the highlands. The tall
    trees here will provide excellent cover. At the misty peak of this mountain,
    I have arranged for the great one to meet with you. Seek him out.\r\r-Fujin"
