  m_Text: 'Choose one of the training options. Each hit reduces energy, but increases
    your EXP.


    You will fight an immobile ward that is capable of casting certain
    spells.


    It gets stronger depending on the type of training you choose.


    Hitting
    the enemy when its shield is down gains you double amount of EXP per Hit.'
